====Daedalus Attack====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=tizoc_236236B,tizoc_236236D
|input=236236B/D
|input2=qcfqcf+B/D
|captions=<br>Attack animation,<br>D super flash
|description2= A series of strikes with Tizoc's fists. Used to end combos and in super cancels.
----
1-bar version ('''236236B'''):
* This is not a reversal, it is only invulnerable up to frame 3. Can become a reversal and, unlike the grab super, will even beat safejumps if used as a guard cancel.
* At max range, the second and third hit may not combo, even if the first hit lands. This makes it ineffective as a standalone punish tool.
* On hit, dash 3 times to be +5 at point blank range. 214C (do not brake) will leave Tizoc +1 at point blank range, allowing 360C / 360AC to grab the opponent on their earliest grabbable frame.
----
2-bar version ('''236236D'''):
* Fully invulnerable and can function as a reversal, unlike the 1-bar version.
* Switches sides with the opponent, but also leaves Tizoc +36 at point blank range with no movement needed. This opens up numerous options for oki:
** An immediate dash followed by feint will reduce the advantage to 0, allowing a 5F grab to hit on the opponent's first grabbable frame. Alternatively, whiff any 2 of the following moves twice: 2A, 2B, Close C
** Empty hop forward is -1 after landing (can block a reversal)
** Whiff Close D (+9), a Close B launched immediately after will be +10 on hit and +8 on block
** Whiff 2C or 2D (+2), a 360A will hit on the first grabbable frame 
}}

